uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02d3a4ffeeb546cd116bbc5fbcc52168 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02a2e7b09df4da36032f4348466e3943", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02a2e7b09df4da36032f4348466e3943, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65b5c959e8441a2d1bd2f1d96171a5ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=df4427741ace54ce5d2a13613bfbef81 3x"}, "body": "Hello from America \u2606\n\nFalco and Katt are my favorite pairing in Star Fox. I am moved by their past, and they're just so cute together! I would to commission a piece if them in a loving embrace. \u2661 The idea:\n\nFalco is behind Katt with his arms around her neck, gently hugging her. Katt has her hand (or hands) on his arms, returning the embrace. Their heads are turned toward one another; perhaps even they're nuzzling cheeks. \u2661 If you would decorate the painting with flowers like I've seen in your other pictures, that would be wonderful. It's so sweet. Other than that, I leave the details up to you; eyes open/closed, what they're wearing, if anything, and whatever else you could think of. I trust your artistic talents, Ulalako-sensei. \u2606\n\nThanks a ton!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/wo